#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/quickstart.rst:2
msgid "快速入门"
msgstr "Quick Start"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/quickstart.rst:4
msgid ""
"本页运行一个最小的 Python SDK 仿真。使用 VS Code / code-server 工作台时，可先阅读 "
":doc:`user_guide`；从配置文件运行实验时，阅读 :doc:`cli`。"
msgstr ""
"This page runs a minimal Python SDK simulation. For the VS Code / code-server "
"workbench, start with :doc:`user_guide`; for configuration-based execution, see "
":doc:`cli`."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/quickstart.rst:7
msgid "前置条件"
msgstr "Prerequisites"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/quickstart.rst:9
msgid ""
"先按 :doc:`installation` 安装 SDK 并配置模型。下面代码会访问模型服务；``python`` 应来自已安装 SDK 的环境。也可在项目目录准备 "
"``.env``，在导入 SDK 前用 ``load_dotenv()`` 加载。"
msgstr ""
"Install the SDK and configure models following :doc:`installation`. The code below "
"calls a model service; use ``python`` from the SDK environment. Alternatively, "
"prepare a project ``.env`` and load it with ``load_dotenv()`` before importing the "
"SDK."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/quickstart.rst:12
msgid "创建并运行"
msgstr "Create and run"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/quickstart.rst:14
msgid "通过元数据声明一个参与者，创建共享环境路由，查询画像并推进两个时间步："
msgstr ""
"Declare one participant as metadata, create a shared environment router, query the "
"profile, and advance two steps:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/quickstart.rst:16
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"import asyncio\n"
"from datetime import datetime\n"
"from pathlib import Path\n"
"\n"
"from agentsociety2.env import create_env_router_proxy\n"
"from agentsociety2.society import AgentSociety\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    run_dir = Path(\"run_quickstart\")\n"
"    agent_specs = [\n"
"        {\n"
"            \"id\": 1,\n"
"            \"profile\": {\"name\": \"Alice\", \"age\": 28, \"bio\": \"Enjoys reading.\"},\n"
"            \"config\": {},\n"
"        }\n"
"    ]\n"
"    env_router = await create_env_router_proxy(\n"
"        [\"SimpleSocialSpace\"],\n"
"        {\"SimpleSocialSpace\": {\"agent_id_name_pairs\": [(1, \"Alice\")]}},\n"
"        run_dir=run_dir,\n"
"    )\n"
"    society = AgentSociety(\n"
"        agent_specs=agent_specs,\n"
"        agent_class_name=\"PersonAgent\",\n"
"        env_router=env_router,\n"
"        start_t=datetime(2026, 1, 1, 8, 0),\n"
"        run_dir=run_dir,\n"
"    )\n"
"    try:\n"
"        await society.init()\n"
"        answer = await society.ask(\n"
"            \"Use get_agent_profile for name=Alice. Summarize the profile.\"\n"
"        )\n"
"        print(answer)\n"
"        await society.run(num_steps=2, tick=600)\n"
"        print(society.all_token_stats())\n"
"    finally:\n"
"        await society.close()\n"
"\n"
"if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n"
"    asyncio.run(main())"
msgstr ""
"import asyncio\n"
"from datetime import datetime\n"
"from pathlib import Path\n"
"\n"
"from agentsociety2.env import create_env_router_proxy\n"
"from agentsociety2.society import AgentSociety\n"
"\n"
"async def main():\n"
"    run_dir = Path(\"run_quickstart\")\n"
"    agent_specs = [\n"
"        {\n"
"            \"id\": 1,\n"
"            \"profile\": {\"name\": \"Alice\", \"age\": 28, \"bio\": \"Enjoys reading.\"},\n"
"            \"config\": {},\n"
"        }\n"
"    ]\n"
"    env_router = await create_env_router_proxy(\n"
"        [\"SimpleSocialSpace\"],\n"
"        {\"SimpleSocialSpace\": {\"agent_id_name_pairs\": [(1, \"Alice\")]}},\n"
"        run_dir=run_dir,\n"
"    )\n"
"    society = AgentSociety(\n"
"        agent_specs=agent_specs,\n"
"        agent_class_name=\"PersonAgent\",\n"
"        env_router=env_router,\n"
"        start_t=datetime(2026, 1, 1, 8, 0),\n"
"        run_dir=run_dir,\n"
"    )\n"
"    try:\n"
"        await society.init()\n"
"        answer = await society.ask(\n"
"            \"Use get_agent_profile for name=Alice. Summarize the profile.\"\n"
"        )\n"
"        print(answer)\n"
"        await society.run(num_steps=2, tick=600)\n"
"        print(society.all_token_stats())\n"
"    finally:\n"
"        await society.close()\n"
"\n"
"if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n"
"    asyncio.run(main())"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/quickstart.rst:60
msgid ""
"``agent_specs`` 描述画像与配置，由 ``init()`` 创建 Agent 工作目录；不直接用画像参数构造 ``PersonAgent`` "
"实例。``create_env_router_proxy`` 让各 Ray worker 访问同一环境，使用方式与 CLI 一致。"
msgstr ""
"``agent_specs`` declares profiles and configuration; ``init()`` creates the agent "
"workspaces. Do not construct ``PersonAgent`` instances with profile arguments. "
"``create_env_router_proxy`` gives Ray workers access to a shared environment, as in "
"the CLI."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/quickstart.rst:62
msgid ""
"``tick`` 的单位是秒，表示每步模拟时间跨度，不是等待的真实秒数。回答和 Agent 决策随模型与上下文变化；运行记录在 "
"``run_quickstart/``。再次独立运行时使用新的输出目录；恢复实验见 :doc:`cli`。"
msgstr ""
"``tick`` is simulated seconds per step, not a real-time delay. Answers and agent "
"decisions depend on the model and context. Run records are written to "
"``run_quickstart/``. Use a new output directory for another independent run; see "
":doc:`cli` for recovery."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/quickstart.rst:65
msgid "检查结果"
msgstr "Inspect results"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/quickstart.rst:67
msgid "查看终端输出与 ``run_quickstart/SOCIETY_STEP.json`` 确认推进进度，结合调用记录检查错误。"
msgstr ""
"Check terminal output and ``run_quickstart/SOCIETY_STEP.json`` for progress, and "
"inspect call records for errors."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/quickstart.rst:68
msgid "``run_quickstart/replay/`` 保存 catalog 与时序数据；可用字段取决于实际写入的数据集。"
msgstr ""
"``run_quickstart/replay/`` stores the catalog and temporal data; available fields "
"depend on the datasets actually recorded."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/quickstart.rst:69
msgid "``run_quickstart/agents/`` 保存人物的持久状态，``run_quickstart/trace/`` 保存调用记录。"
msgstr ""
"``run_quickstart/agents/`` stores participant state; ``run_quickstart/trace/`` stores"
" call records."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/quickstart.rst:71
msgid ""
"回放与报告入口见 :doc:`results`；程序读取方法见 :doc:`storage`。SDK 直接运行的目录可用 ``ReplayReader`` "
"读取；插件回放默认从研究工作区的假设 / 实验目录读取数据。"
msgstr ""
"See :doc:`results` for replay and reports, and :doc:`storage` for programmatic "
"access. Direct SDK output can be read with ``ReplayReader``; extension replay reads "
"hypothesis/experiment directories in a research workspace by default."

