#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/quickstart.rst:89
msgid "推进参与者、环境与仿真时钟。"
msgstr "Advance participants, environment, and simulation clock."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/quickstart.rst:91
msgid ""
"查询画像中的已有字段时，可明确请求 ``get_agent_profile``；需要参与者作答时，明确 Agent 编号并请求 "
"``ask_agents``。只读查询仍可能留下日志；它不会自动推进仿真时钟。详细交互方法见 :doc:`interaction`。"
msgstr ""
"For existing profile fields, explicitly request ``get_agent_profile``. To obtain a "
"participant response, specify the agent ID and request ``ask_agents``. Read-only "
"queries may still write logs and do not automatically advance the clock. See "
":doc:`interaction` for details."

